The scope of the project is as follows:
Using the HIPAA guidelines, use existing AI engines to create a case scenario to demonstrate how to achieve compliance to de-identification standards

Input: Start by prompting a conversation with the AI engine to assess contextual awareness of the topic. Once the engine references information on HIPAA compliance, ask to demonstrate non-compliance with a simple prompt:  
Please create a non-compliant case based on the 18 indentifiers
As part of the assessment of the output, I focus on the following:

1. Can the AI create a convincing clinical scenario
2. Does it pay attention to the tone, adequately using medical terminology
3. Are there any detectable errors or hallucinations
4. Are there any biases detected
